om one video to another without tearing it down."}],"kind":"article","type":"topic","url":"\/documentation\/ybvrapplesdk\/contentswitching"},"doc://applesdk.YBVRAppleSDK/documentation/YBVRAppleSDK/AdInsertion":{"role":"article","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Schedule ad breaks against the content timeline and drive your own ad UI."}],"kind":"article","identifier":"doc:\/\/applesdk.YBVRAppleSDK\/documentation\/YBVRAppleSDK\/AdInsertion","url":"\/documentation\/ybvrapplesdk\/adinsertion","type":"topic","title":"Inserting Ads"}}}